   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Coyote's greetings! 🦊",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's really incredible! Laika has been available for just over 24 hours and we have already received so much feedback from all of you out there! Please keep it coming, as it is highly valuable for us! ❤️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And so we could release the very first update 1.0.3 for Laika: Aged Through Blood today. The update fixes some bugs and also makes some small changes. This is the complete list:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fix (Softblock): Player can't get back on the bike after hopping off in certain parkings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix: Camera is off-centered to the right in some areas of the Mines",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix: Typos and incorrect button prompts in tutorial boxes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix: Destroying a dragged bomb doesn't roll back the hook",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The game now checks for completed steam achievements when the save is loaded",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Lowered default deadzone for right joystick to 0.2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added cooldown to UI input to improve navigation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated credits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have a great time with Laika and her trusted motorbike!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Brainwash Gang",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
